 * cac Controller qua constructor (tiem phu thuoc bang tay — Spring Boot lam dung viec nay
 * bang @Autowired). Day la noi DUY NHAT biet kho nam o dau: chang sau doi 3 dong new
 * FileXxxRepository thanh JdbcXxxRepository (PostgreSQL), khong lop nao khac doi.
 * Ba Controller cung nhin MOT kho sach: muon o LoanController thi bao cao thay ngay.
 *
 * @author CuongThai Academy
